(Notwithstanding anything contained in this Act or any other law for the time being in force, no person shall, after the) Tj
T* (commencement of this Act, let or take on rent any premises except by an agreement in writing, which shall be registered with) Tj
T* (the Rent Controller in such manner as may be prescribed.) Tj
